{"id":"6012ed8c9d9b861e","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-prefix-product-measure.md","title":"代码拼接幂的测度相乘","display":"thm-prefix-product-measure — 代码拼接幂的测度相乘","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-prefix-product-measure","aliases":["20-thm-prefix-product-measure"],"display":"thm-prefix-product-measure — 代码拼接幂的测度相乘","chapter":"11","section":"11.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 11.3.2 的测度计算","source_printed_pages":[192],"source_pdf_pages":[223],"depends_on":["[[20-df-prefix-products]]","[[20-df-cantor-measure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-prefix-product-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-prefix-product-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-prefix-product-measure — 代码拼接幂的测度相乘"},{"key":"chapter","html":"11"},{"key":"section","html":"11.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 11.3.2 的测度计算"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>192</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>223</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fabbb72b95296700\" href=\"?note=fabbb72b95296700\" title=\"20-df-prefix-products\">20-df-prefix-products</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"978bb51599bc5702\" href=\"?note=978bb51599bc5702\" title=\"20-df-cantor-measure\">20-df-cantor-measure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 前缀自由、不含空串；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_n=\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in P^{\\langle n\\rangle}}[\\sigma]\">\\(U_n=\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in P^{\\langle n\\rangle}}[\\sigma]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q=\\mu(U_1)\">\\(q=\\mu(U_1)\\)</span>；约定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q^0=1\">\\(q^0=1\\)</span>，包括 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q=0\">\\(q=0\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fabbb72b95296700\" href=\"?note=fabbb72b95296700\" title=\"20-df-prefix-products\">20-df-prefix-products</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"978bb51599bc5702\" href=\"?note=978bb51599bc5702\" title=\"20-df-cantor-measure\">20-df-cantor-measure</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}prefix-product-measure}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\ [\\mu(U_n)=q^n\\land U_{n+1}\\subseteq U_n].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}prefix-product-measure}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\ [\\mu(U_n)=q^n\\land U_{n+1}\\subseteq U_n].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>拼接幂仍前缀自由且解析唯一；对不交柱的概率求和，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{\\sigma,\\tau}2^{-|\\sigma|-|\\tau|}\">\\(\\sum_{\\sigma,\\tau}2^{-|\\sigma|-|\\tau|}\\)</span> 分解为两个非负级数乘积，归纳得结论。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> c.e.，所有幂的覆盖一致 c.e.。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q=0\">\\(q=0\\)</span> 的边界取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_0=2^\\omega\">\\(U_0=2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(U_0)=1\">\\(\\mu(U_0)=1\\)</span>，并依明示的零次幂约定解释公式。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 11.3.2 的测度计算；印刷页 192；PDF 第 223 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[As